591
00:48:02,669 --> 00:48:05,297
Eu tive. Uma vez.

592
00:48:05,672 --> 00:48:08,217
<i>O nome dele era Morgan.

593
00:48:08,425 --> 00:48:10,719
<i>Morgan? Morgan.

594
00:48:10,928 --> 00:48:13,222
