595
00:48:15,307 --> 00:48:17,935
Surpresa!

596
00:48:21,939 --> 00:48:24,274
Feliz aniversário, Kate.

597
00:48:24,942 --> 00:48:28,695
- Feliz aniversário.
- Feliz aniversário.

598
00:48:29,822 --> 00:48:32,658
